---

The attractor definitions in src/attractors.js — the systems, their parameters,
their integration steps and their view transforms — are derived from Ricky
Reusser's Observable notebook "Strange Attractors on the GPU, Part 2"
(https://observablehq.com/@rreusser/strange-attractors-on-the-gpu-part-2),
as are the quasirandom seeding and the grid-room shader. Each attractor's
originating paper is cited in src/attractors.js and shown in the overlay.
